{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/15686","id":3335133758,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q87Gyho-","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15686","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15686.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15686.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15686","number":15686,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: create new middleware mode `\"on-request\"`","user":{"login":"leekeh","id":71131586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMTMxNTg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71131586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekeh","html_url":"https://github.com/leekeh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekeh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekeh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekeh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekeh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekeh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekeh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekeh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekeh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leekeh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Implement the work needed to make middleware run properly on request of static pages. Prerendered pages are stored and read from the disk, but the middleware will run first, if the user has turned on one of these new middleware modes.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Expose + implement `on-request` middleware mode\r\n- When on-request middleware is enabled for prerendered pages, pass around a function that is able to fetch the prerendered html\r\n- Implement for node adapter. Others can follow, but node adapter is prioritized since it is widely used and does not support edge middleware.\r\n\r\n### Context\r\n\r\nCurrently, middleware runs on static pages during build, and on dynamic pages after build. There is the need to customize this behavior, specifically to run middleware on static pages, for example to add an authentication check. \r\n\r\nA first step was to refactor the code a bit to create the `middlewareMode` adapter feature in #15495 \r\nThis PR implements the `on-request` and `always` middleware modes.\r\n\r\n| Mode | Build-time (prerendered pages) | Request-time (SSR pages) | Request-time (prerendered pages) | Use case |\r\n|------|:---:|:---:|:---:|---------|\r\n| `\"classic\"` (default) | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | Today's default. Middleware affects static pages only at build time. |\r\n| `\"always\"` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | Middleware runs everywhere. Good for auth, A/B testing, personalization on all pages. |\r\n| `\"on-request\"` | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ | Middleware only runs at request time. For runtime-only concerns (auth headers, sessions). |\r\n| `\"edge\"` | ❌ | ❌ (separate bundle) | ❌ (separate bundle) | Middleware deployed as a separate edge function (Vercel, Netlify). Formerly known as `edgeMiddleware` config option. |\r\n\r\nRelated discussions:\r\n- https://github.com/withastro/roadmap/discussions/869\r\n- https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/14617#issuecomment-3595743217\r\n\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\nTest cases were added on the core lib, expanding the app middleware tests and adding a static middleware test.\r\nTests were added for node, adding onto the prerendering fixture.\r\n\r\n## Docs\r\n\r\nDocs added/updated :) For now in draft, want to see what you guys think of the implementation first.\r\nhttps://github.com/withastro/docs/pull/14117\r\n\r\n<!-- Could this affect a user’s behavior? We probably need to update docs! -->\r\n<!-- If docs will be needed or you’re not sure, uncomment the next line: -->\r\n/cc @withastro/maintainers-docs for feedback!\r\n\r\n<!-- DON'T DELETE THIS SECTION! If no docs added, explain why.-->\r\n<!-- https://github.com/withastro/docs -->\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2026-02-27T10:35:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T14:24:50Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":3551728751,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87TsxRv","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20example","name":"pkg: example","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to an example package (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3559102393,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20integration","name":"pkg: integration","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to any renderer integration (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3559105225,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI6LJ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20astro","name":"pkg: astro","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to the core `astro` package (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4455040104,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABCYqEaA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/semver:%20minor","name":"semver: minor","color":"bcf5db","default":false,"description":"Change triggers a `minor` release","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7382219872,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABuAO8YA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/docs%20pr","name":"docs pr","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/15686/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/15686/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15686/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/st